# Backend API base URL. Leave EMPTY for local dev (Vite proxies /v1 → :8001)
# or when the backend serves the built frontend.
#
# For a split deploy (frontend on Vercel, backend on Render), set this in Vercel's
# Environment Variables to your Render backend URL (no trailing slash), e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://resume-screener-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE=
